SUMMARY:Data Centre Public Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by Scarborough Southwest Councillor Parthi Kandavel. Discuss community concerns around environmental impacts\, ask questions and share feedback. City staff from Planning & Environment\, Climate and Forestry\, and STACK Infrastructure staff\, will be in attendance. RSVP and info: www.parthikandavel.ca
