SUMMARY:Elite Explorers 🧭 Open House
DESCRIPTION:Luxury travel. Expedition adventure. Exclusive offers you won’t want to miss. \nThis is your invitation to discover extraordinary journeys—from sipping champagne on a private balcony at sea to exploring remote\, bucket-list destinations with expert-led experiences designed to take you beyond the ordinary. \nYou’ll Discover: \n• Exclusive offers on luxury vacations & expedition cruises\n• Tailor-made travel experiences designed around you\n• Access to our Elite Explorer’s summer Promotion: July 15 – Aug 5\n• Your chance to win a FREE cruise for 2 (including airfare!)*\n• Light refreshments\, elegant bites\, and exciting door prizes \nStop in during our Open House on July 15th or 16th\, and step into a world of curated travel inspiration and limited-time opportunities. No obligation to buy\, just an opportunity to dream ! \nSee you then !
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/elite-explorers-%f0%9f%a7%ad-open-house/
LOCATION:Expedia Cruises at The Beach\, 2255 Queen St East\, Toronto\, M4E 1G3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/10143819/IMG_0732.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="Expedia Cruises at The Beach":MAILTO:thebeach@expediacruises.com
END:VEVENT
