SUMMARY:Baby & Me Strength Yoga: In the Park
DESCRIPTION:Gather your little ones and join us for an invigorating movement session that caters to every body. The “Baby & Me Strength” classes are thoughtfully designed to incorporate elements of strength training\, cardiovascular exercises\, core work\, and stretching – ensuring a well-rounded experience. \nBabies are welcome to rest\, play\, or be incorporated into movements as you feel comfortable. Expect a relaxed\, supportive environment where you can move at your own pace and find your community!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/baby-me-strength-yoga-in-the-park/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/09153747/wellbe-workshops-toronto-baby-and-me-yoga-1.png
END:VEVENT
