SUMMARY:Keep Pride Going: Arts & Crafts Day!
DESCRIPTION:Keep Pride Going Event! July 18 • 10-12:30\nCelebrating who we are is all year round! June was fun\, but let’s keep it going with some fun easy crafts and activities! ALL AGES WELCOME!\nAll children must be with an adult\, but adults don’t need children to join in!\nExpress yourself with:\nDance with Pegasus Dance Studios\n• Face Painting with King Julez\nButton Making • Pipecleaner Art • Friendship Bracelets\n• Toronto PFLAG • EarlyON\nInclusive Books display and more! Light Snacks and Refreshments!\nSee you there!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/keep-pride-going-arts-crafts-day/
LOCATION:Kimbourne Park United Church\, 200 Wolverleigh blvd\, Toronto\, M4C 1S2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/10142213/Keep-Pride-Going-2.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Kimbourne Park United Church":MAILTO:office@kpuc.org
END:VEVENT
